                                                "sense_id": "3f607906-f2b0-3568-8c57-49f1e1551085",
                                                "text": "Why is translation suitable as a subject-matter of academic study, or to raise this question in a somewhat different and perhaps more challenging form: What distinguishes everyday, intralingual communication from interlingual, \"exceptional\" communication?"
